{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:283","content":{"id":283,"title":"为什么要用自己的话记笔记","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"31ab1808-512c-43c7-a45b-7d55cd195fd0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记笔记遇到的问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"abae75ce-a2ec-494b-9121-0dfedc0cf067","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"93941dfe-32fd-4e74-b0b8-97224457b744","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c69ee86-cff9-4de9-86ff-b6fa38e18449","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要解决问题时想不起来记的笔记"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"04b189ef-216f-4527-99c7-686175d271cd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f46e1b4-736c-456e-b3b2-9906a9449058","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"找到了相关的笔记，却难以应用"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"93189466-a29b-44ba-91b5-e54022258f75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一个问题，为什么想不起来，有一个"},{"type":"content-link","refId":30,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":27,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"d3f2f0fe-8219-4817-bb3e-97a09fd2bcb7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"必要难度理论"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，存储越容易，提取就越困难，反之存储越困难，提取就越容易。我们经常会把收集和记笔记弄错，收藏文章、划线、摘录存储太容易了，提取就会很困难。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"06ba5242-1b9d-4a0f-adb0-110fde9adc7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二个问题在于在记录笔记时没有预思考，即使找到了相关的笔记，由于是摘录，收藏，复制粘贴的内容，缺少上下文，或者没有经过整理，即使找到了还需要重新阅读思考整理，导致无法拿来即用，甚至难以应用。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"10a2fc2f-263e-40e2-b27a-34cb6bf9dbdc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用自己的话记录能解决以上问题，第一用自己的话记录，需要不停的思考，"},{"type":"content-link","refId":33,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":30,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"29d4eb72-6cd8-4982-8f9f-9a44fdc44fd0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"写作即思考"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而思考就是在增加存储的难度，这样印象就会深刻，提取时就会更加容易；第二，用自己的话记录的笔记是自己的思考过的内容，这样在后续被发现时，已经被理解消化过，我们能很快地进行应用。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"12bf797a-a551-4073-850b-6ca2e6196cc6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用自己的话记笔记和费曼学习法有异曲同工之妙，费曼学习法强调将知识讲给别人听，如果别人能听懂，那么就可以认为自己掌握了知识，做笔记就相当于讲给未来的自己听，你假想给未来的自己讲述，如果未来的自己在遗失大部分记忆的情况下还能看懂，那么这则笔记就是成功的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f691d608-7be2-4171-b84e-271223cbf910","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但并不是所有的笔记都适用于用自己的话重新复述一遍，比如对于操作步骤、诗句、令人启发的金句，这些还是可以摘录的。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"记录篇，如何记笔记，做好信息预处理","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:281","type":"doc","id":281}},{"label":"用自己的话做笔记","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:284","type":"doc","id":284}},{"label":"为什么要用自己的话记笔记","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:283","type":"doc","id":283}}],"prevPage":{"title":"用自己的话做笔记","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:284","type":"doc","id":284}},"nextPage":{"title":"用自己的话记笔记的建议","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:285","type":"doc","id":285}},"createTime":1743345415870,"updateTime":1744964640571,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744964640571},"links":{"card:30":{"key":"card:30","type":"card","id":30},"card:33":{"key":"card:33","type":"card","id":33}}}